---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Legionella Risk Assessment Glasgow | Scotland EPC"
  description="Book a Glasgow Legionella risk assessment with Scotland EPC. Practical reports for landlords and property managers across Glasgow and nearby areas."
  canonicalPath="/legionella-risk-assessment-glasgow"
>
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-pro max-w-4xl space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Legionella Risk Assessments in Glasgow</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-700">For Glasgow rental properties, a Legionella assessment helps you understand potential water-system risks and document sensible control measures. Scotland EPC keeps the process clear and practical.</p>
      <div class="quote-card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Assessment focus</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>Potential stagnation points and outlet usage patterns.</li>
          <li>Hot and cold water arrangements in domestic settings.</li>
          <li>Useful notes for landlord records and follow-up actions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-700">Request your booking through the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/#quote">Scotland EPC quote form</a> or call <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="tel:+447483881889">+44 7483 881889</a>.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-700">You can also book an <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/epc-glasgow">EPC assessment in Glasgow</a> or compare <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/legionella-risk-assessment-edinburgh">Edinburgh Legionella appointments</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
